{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{"subheading":"","show_title":true,"heading_font_size":"heading-large","show_content":true,"text_font_size":"body-medium","align_text":"text-left","width":"wrapper","color_scheme":"","padding_top":50,"padding_bottom":50,"heading_tag":"automatic"}},"section_rich_text_P3Y8BT":{"type":"section-rich-text","blocks":{"heading_8imQrc":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"BABI, Édition Mantra","heading_font_size":"heading-x-large","padding_bottom":16,"heading_tag":"automatic"}},"subheading_CENNHg":{"type":"subheading","settings":{"subheading":"Les petits objets qu'on garde tout près.","padding_bottom":16}},"text_prwBdn":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Il y a des sacs qu'on porte tous les jours. Et il y a ceux auxquels on s'attache. BABI, c'est notre collection de sacs iconiques en miniature. Des petits objets à collectionner, à offrir, ou à garder rien que pour toi.<\/p>","text_font_size":"body-medium","padding_bottom":16}}},"block_order":["heading_8imQrc","subheading_CENNHg","text_prwBdn"],"name":"Rich text","settings":{"align_text":"text-center","width":"wrapper","color_scheme":"","overlay_type":"disabled","padding_top":100,"padding_bottom":0}},"section_multicolumn_xKM9TM":{"type":"section-multicolumn","blocks":{"image_MQCkCh":{"type":"image","settings":{"column_width":50,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/BlindboxBaby-Boitesmysteres_5.jpg","image_width":100,"image_aspect_ratio":1.5,"mobile_image_aspect_ratio":1.5,"image_shape":"normal","title":"","heading_font_size":"heading-small","text":"","text_font_size":"body-medium","button_text":"","button_url":"shopify:\/\/products\/blindbox-babi-edition-mantra","button_type":"btn--primary","button_style":"btn--solid","show_arrow":false,"heading_tag":"automatic"}},"image_R3VbXK":{"type":"image","settings":{"column_width":50,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Babi_bestini_paris_2.jpg","image_width":100,"image_aspect_ratio":1.5,"mobile_image_aspect_ratio":1.5,"image_shape":"normal","title":"","heading_font_size":"heading-small","text":"","text_font_size":"body-medium","button_text":"","button_url":"shopify:\/\/products\/blindbox-babi-edition-mantra","button_type":"btn--primary","button_style":"btn--solid","show_arrow":false,"heading_tag":"automatic"}}},"block_order":["image_MQCkCh","image_R3VbXK"],"name":"Multi column","settings":{"title":"","heading_font_size":"heading-medium","description":"","align_heading":"text-left","align_text":"text-left","width":"wrapper--full-padded","align_columns":"flex-align-top","layout_mobile":"1","color_scheme":"","padding_top":50,"padding_bottom":50,"heading_tag":"automatic"}},"section_rich_text_pADdLn":{"type":"section-rich-text","blocks":{"heading_8cd8hR":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"Tu ne sais pas lequel t'attend.","heading_font_size":"heading-large","padding_bottom":16,"heading_tag":"automatic"}},"text_jVJd9W":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Chaque Blindbox cache un BABI tiré au hasard. Tu ne le choisis pas. Tu l'ouvres, tu le découvres. Comme un petit cadeau que tu te fais à toi-même. Et c'est là tout le plaisir.<\/p>","text_font_size":"body-medium","padding_bottom":16}},"columns_3_kgbwi9":{"type":"columns_3","settings":{"heading_font_size":"heading-x-small","text_font_size":"body-medium","column_1_title":"Avant d'ouvrir, pose une intention.","column_1_text":"<p>Prends une seconde. Pense à quelque chose qui compte pour toi. Puis ouvre la boîte. Ça fait du bien, parfois, de laisser un peu de place à la surprise.<\/p>","column_2_title":"Un mantra rien que pour toi. 🤍","column_2_text":"<p>Dans chaque BABI se glisse une carte, choisie parmi vingt mantras. Une phrase à la manière d'un cookie fortune, qui tombe rarement par hasard. À lire, à ranger dans ton portefeuille, à accrocher sur ton miroir. « Si cette phrase est arrivée jusqu'à toi, c'est qu'elle est ce dont tu as le plus besoin ce mois-ci. »<\/p>","column_3_title":"Fait avec soin.","column_3_text":"<p>Chaque BABI est réalisé à la main, dans l'atelier Bestini. On lui donne vie à partir des chutes de nos collections, pour que rien de beau ne se perde. Puis on le parfume, tout en délicatesse, d'une fragrance française. Assez petit pour te suivre partout : porte-monnaie, étui pour tes Pods, ou bijou accroché à ton sac.<\/p>","button_open_text":"En savoir plus","button_close_text":"Voir moins","padding_bottom":16}}},"block_order":["heading_8cd8hR","text_jVJd9W","columns_3_kgbwi9"],"name":"Rich text","settings":{"align_text":"text-center","width":"wrapper","color_scheme":"","overlay_type":"disabled","padding_top":100,"padding_bottom":0}},"section_hero_UNA4jW":{"type":"section-hero","name":"Image banner","settings":{"image_1":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/All_blindbox_babi_mystere.png","link":"","width":"wrapper--full","height":"image-height","flex_align_desktop":"align--middle-center-desktop","content_width":50,"mobile_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/babigold_1.png","mobile_height":"image-height--mobile","flex_align_mobile":"align--middle-center-mobile","color_scheme":"","show_text_background":false,"overlay_type":"disabled","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0,"show_placeholder":true}},"section_rich_text_ppXCBH":{"type":"section-rich-text","blocks":{"text_bfXjCt":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p><strong>Chez Bestini.<\/strong> On aime les objets qui durent et qui racontent quelque chose. Ceux qui font sourire sans qu'on sache vraiment pourquoi. On espère que ton BABI sera de ceux-là. 🤍<\/p>","text_font_size":"body-medium","padding_bottom":16}}},"block_order":["text_bfXjCt"],"name":"Rich text","settings":{"align_text":"text-center","width":"wrapper","color_scheme":"","overlay_type":"disabled","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":100}},"section_multicolumn_HtpFqe":{"type":"section-multicolumn","blocks":{"image_zPGdMA":{"type":"image","settings":{"column_width":50,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/BlindboxBaby-Boitesmysteres_6.jpg","image_width":100,"image_aspect_ratio":1.5,"mobile_imag